 to do a detailed analysis of the attendance and reflect on it. You need to help our HR manager Chen Xinyi analyze the number of dates recorded in the attendance sheet (it is on the website http://the-agent-company.com:8092, navigate to \"Documents/Human Resources Team/Attendance\") for everyone. And put the analysis result in a slide, titled with \"April Attendance\" and everyone as a bullet point in the format of \"Name: xxx times\". Save the slide as \"/workspace/April Attendance.pptx\" and tell Chen Xinyi the path you saved it. You can find Chen Xinyi on RocketChat (http://the-agent-company.com:3000/)\\n     2\\t\\n     3\\t\\n', path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}, thought='Now I understand the task. I need to:\\n1. Access the attendance sheet on http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Navigate to \"Documents/Human Resources Team/Attendance\"\\n3. Analyze the number of dates recorded for everyone\\n4. Create a PowerPoint slide with the analysis\\n5. Save it as \"/workspace/April Attendance.pptx\"\\n6. Tell Chen Xinyi on RocketChat where I saved it\\n\\nLet me first check if there are any existing SOPs for working with OwnCloud and RocketChat.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'ownCloud\\': Authentication, FileNavigation, FileUploadDownload, CreateCareerLadderDocument, AttendanceAnalysis, FindAndDownloadSeedAreaFile, CompleteIRSForm6765, PaymentMatchingAnalysis, CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink, CreateEmployeeManual, FindImmigrationFilingDates, CreateSalaryIncreaseMEMOTemplate, RetrieveEquipmentPriceList, ExcelFormattingAndUpload, StockAnalysisAndPresentation\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_platform_guide_list', argument